{"version":"1","id":"twitter","handle":"twitter","name":"Twitter Engineering","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/t_logo,f_auto/v1/logos/twitter","description":null,"is_squad":false,"x":-5.028,"y":-3.6748,"cluster_id":1,"posts_collected":135,"newest_post_at":"2024-02-14T00:10:56.126Z","oldest_post_at":"2017-06-27T07:00:00.000Z","features":{"hype_score":0.0,"listicle_ratio":0.0,"question_ratio":0.0,"avg_read_time":5.288462,"summary_length_avg":349.744681,"title_length_avg":48.266667,"title_length_var":234.136296,"tag_entropy":3.307385,"tag_diversity":0.407407,"top_tag_share":0.392593,"avg_upvotes":0.303704,"median_upvotes":0.0,"avg_comments":0.044444,"comment_to_upvote_ratio":0.166667,"zero_engagement_share":0.82963,"viral_share":0.0,"posts_per_week":0.442337,"non_article_ratio":0.0,"author_present_share":0.0,"recency_skew":0.054688},"view_coords":{"engagement_style":[-7.0,3.4559],"cadence_depth":[1.25,-1.6029],"hype_variety":[-4.25,1.3971],"title_style":[-4.4559,-1.0294]},"top_tags":[["tech-news",58],["machine-learning",15],["twitter",13],["deep-learning",13],["data-science",10],["general-programming",9],["gcp",7],["cloud",7]],"sample_titles":{"representative":["Powering real-time data analytics with Druid at Twitter","Twitter Recommendation Algorithm","GNNs through the lens of differential geometry and algebraic topology"],"outlier":["Embeddings@Twitter"]},"recent_posts":[{"id":"Ct4RCmJik","title":"Kerberizing Hadoop Clusters at Twitter","url":"https://blog.x.com/engineering/en_us/topics/infrastructure/2023/kerberizing-hadoop-clusters-at-twitter","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/kerberizing-hadoop-clusters-at-twitter-ct4rcmjik","summary":"Twitter faced challenges in kerberizing their Hadoop clusters, but they were able to enforce strong Authentication, Authorization, and Accountability for Hadoop data access by making code changes, developing keytab generation and distribution services, and implementing delegation token renewal. They took a multi-pronged approach to kerberizing their clusters one at a time, with minimal disruption to customer use cases.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/da1628b7e034040480b783b852745e66?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-02-14T00:10:56.126Z"},{"id":"IfBi3wOGP","title":"The data platform cluster operator service for Hadoop cluster management","url":"https://blog.x.com/engineering/en_us/topics/infrastructure/2023/the-data-platform-cluster-operator-service-for-hadoop-cluster-management","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/the-data-platform-cluster-operator-service-for-hadoop-cluster-management-ifbi3wogp","summary":"Introducing the Data Platform Cluster Operator (DCO) service for managing Hadoop clusters. Streamlining operations, maintenance, and scalability for the SRE team. Built in Python, it provides efficient solutions for cluster management.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/da1628b7e034040480b783b852745e66?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-02-14T00:10:56.126Z"},{"id":"hBs1u3lqe","title":"Measuring the impact of Twitter network latency with CausalImpact","url":"https://blog.x.com/engineering/en_us/topics/insights/2022/measuring-the-impact-of-twitter-network-latency-with-causalimpac","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/measuring-the-impact-of-twitter-network-latency-with-causalimpact-hbs1u3lqe","summary":"Twitter customers are affected by network latency, and an experiment was conducted to lower latency using a faster public cloud edge. The impact of the experiment was measured using the CausalImpact package from Google, which offers flexibility and modularity. A robust framework was developed for the causal impact analysis, and key metrics were selected to quantify the impact. The analysis revealed insights and challenges, including the importance of validation techniques and the potential impact of external shocks.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/da1628b7e034040480b783b852745e66?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-02-14T00:10:56.126Z"},{"id":"o3dQlI6DY","title":"How we scaled Reads On the Twitter Users Database","url":"https://blog.x.com/engineering/en_us/topics/infrastructure/2023/how-we-scaled-reads-on-the-twitter-users-database","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-we-scaled-reads-on-the-twitter-users-database-o3dqli6dy","summary":"Twitter scaled the reads on their Users Database by using Vitess, an open source database solution for scaling MySQL. They moved the Vtgate component out of the MySQL servers to achieve high read scalability and used Apache Mesos for running containerized applications.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/da1628b7e034040480b783b852745e66?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-02-14T00:10:56.126Z"},{"id":"D6dZVKR5x","title":"Twitter's Recommendation Algorithm","url":"https://blog.x.com/engineering/en_us/topics/open-source/2023/twitter-recommendation-algorithm","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/twitter-s-recommendation-algorithm-d6dzvkr5x","summary":"Twitter's recommendation algorithm selects the top tweets for the For You timeline by using core models and features to extract latent information from tweet, user, and engagement data. The recommendation pipeline consists of candidate sources, real graph ranking, engagements analysis, embedding space approaches, and scoring with a neural network. The goal is to deliver relevant and diverse tweets to users.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/da1628b7e034040480b783b852745e66?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":1,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-02-14T00:10:56.126Z"},{"id":"7iyketnsU","title":"Twitter\u2019s Blobstore Hardware Lifecycle Monitoring and Reporting Service","url":"https://blog.x.com/engineering/en_us/topics/infrastructure/2023/twitters-blobstore-hardware-lifecycle-monitoring-and-reporting-service","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/twitter-s-blobstore-hardware-lifecycle-monitoring-and-reporting-service-7iyketnsu","summary":"Twitter's Blobstore is a low-cost, high-performance, and scalable storage system used to store photos, videos, and other binary large objects. This post explains how Blobstore manages the hardware lifecycle and the different states involved in the process.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/da1628b7e034040480b783b852745e66?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-02-14T00:10:56.126Z"},{"id":"vfnby5bHT","title":"Constraint Management for cluster operation safety and reliability at Twitter","url":"https://blog.x.com/engineering/en_us/topics/infrastructure/2023/constraint-management-for-cluster-operation-safety-and-reliability-at-twitter","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/constraint-management-for-cluster-operation-safety-and-reliability-at-twitter-vfnby5bht","summary":"Twitter has built an internal constraint management service to ensure the safety and reliability of cluster operations. This service considers cluster constraints, such as resource minimums and maximums, and determines if operations can be safely executed. It also collects metrics and provides a dashboard for tracking maintenance activities.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/da1628b7e034040480b783b852745e66?_a=AQAEufR","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2024-02-14T00:10:56.126Z"},{"id":"OU0lBBjan","title":"Twitter Recommendation Algorithm","url":"https://blog.twitter.com/engineering/en_us/topics/open-source/2023/twitter-recommendation-algorithm","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/twitter-recommendation-algorithm-ou0lbbjan","summary":"This blog is an introduction to how the algorithm selects Tweets for your timeline. The foundation of Twitter\u2019s recommendations is a set of core models and features that extract latent information from Tweet, user, and engagement data. The service that is responsible for constructing and serving the For You timeline is called Home Mixer.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a953463fde1ed65c12c2d8b7ae3e5501","num_upvotes":3,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-03-31T18:35:10.585Z"},{"id":"qe0Kv6n54","title":"How we scaled Reads On the Twitter Users Database","url":"https://blog.twitter.com/engineering/en_us/topics/infrastructure/2023/how-we-scaled-reads-on-the-twitter-users-database","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/how-we-scaled-reads-on-the-twitter-users-database-qe0kv6n54","summary":"Twitter operates one of the world\u2019s largest User Reservation Systems, referred to as URS. The URS cluster is a tier 1 application running in production for several months now with an extremely high availability for both writes and reads. Twitter uses Apache Mesos which provides a scalable platform for running containerized applications.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a953463fde1ed65c12c2d8b7ae3e5501","num_upvotes":2,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2023-02-23T21:56:10.383Z"},{"id":"aM3uNczV1","title":"Kerberizing Hadoop Clusters at Twitter","url":"https://blog.twitter.com/engineering/en_us/topics/infrastructure/2023/kerberizing-hadoop-clusters-at-twitter","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/kerberizing-hadoop-clusters-at-twitter-am3unczv1","summary":"Hadoop serves range from general purpose HDFS storage to search, AI/ML, metrics & reporting, spam/abuse prevention, ads and internal tools. The diversity in the use cases means HadoOp hosts several large datasets (including some sensitive ones) that are accessed by a variety of internal teams such as engineering, product, business, finance and legal.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/f_auto,q_auto/v1/posts/a953463f